[h1]Reclaim the Motherland / 重整河山[/h1]

[b]The Mandate may be lost. The dynasty need not vanish with it.[/b]
[b]天命可以失去，王朝不必随之湮灭。[/b]

Version 0.2.0 · CK3 1.19.0.6 · All Under Heaven required

[h1]A New Default Rule / 新增默认规则[/h1]

The game rule “Fate of the Chinese Hegemon” offers two paths. “Reclaim the Motherland” is enabled by default; “Vanilla Shattering” preserves the original behavior.
游戏规则【中华霸权统治者的命运】提供两条路线，默认启用【重整河山】；选择【群雄割据（原版）】即可恢复原版行为。

A second rule, “The Choice of the Loyalists,” defaults to “Divided Hearts.” Choose “Unwavering Loyalty” to preserve the 0.1 behavior where every Pro-Hegemon vassal remains.
第二项规则【尊王诸侯的抉择】默认选择【人心离散】；若希望沿用 0.1 版“尊王派全员留下”的行为，可改选【誓死尊王】。

[h1]When All Under Heaven Fractures / 群雄割据之时[/h1]

[list]
[*]The old ruler loses the Chinese Hegemony, but keeps every personally held domain and unrelated title. / 旧天子失去中华霸权，但进入群雄割据前亲自持有的领地与其他个人头衔仍归本人。
[*]A new empty-de-jure Hegemony is created as “Later + old dynasty name”: for example, Later Song / 后宋. / 创建空法理的“后＋原朝号”霸权，例如【后宋】。
[*]Pro-Hegemon lords now decide once at the moment of fracture. Open war, deep enmity, disloyalty, very low opinion, and independence or claimant factions can force rebellion; close bonds can guarantee loyalty; everyone else weighs opinion, character, rank, military strength, imperial legitimacy, and dread. / 尊王诸侯会在裂解一刻作出一次抉择：战事、深仇、不忠、极低好感以及独立或宣称者派系可令其必叛；深厚羁绊可令其必留；其余人再权衡好感、性情、地位、军力、天子合法性与威慑。
[*]A lord who finally remains keeps the same primary title, displayed or custom realm name, direct liege, and complete subordinate realm tree. “Qingxu Circuit” will not be arbitrarily renamed during the shattering. / 最终留下的忠臣保留原主头衔、显示或自定义国号、直属关系与完整下级封臣树；【青徐路】不会再因群雄割据被随意换号。
[*]Defectors and every other direct vassal break away and continue through vanilla Chaos reorganization. / 反叛的尊王诸侯与其他直属封臣脱离，并继续按原版群雄割据逻辑重组。
[/list]

[h1]Proclaim the Restoration / 宣称复辟[/h1]

A Later-Dynasty holder cannot use the original “Claim the Mandate” decision. During Chaos, once the restorer controls a majority of the Chinese Hegemony's de-jure counties—currently 51%, including qualifying tributary land—“Proclaim the Restoration” becomes available.
后朝持有者不能执行原版【宣称天命】。在群雄割据期间，重新控制中华霸权法理领地的过半伯爵领——当前门槛为 51%，符合条件的朝贡国领地同样计入——即可执行【宣称复辟】。

Restoration completes the same founding of a new dynasty, submission of the warlords, and closure of the Dynastic Cycle as Claim the Mandate; the Later-Dynasty name then passes into history.
宣称复辟后，新朝建立、群雄归附与王朝循环收束均与【宣称天命】一致；后朝之号随即归入历史。

[h1]0.2.0 更新记录[/h1]

[list]
[*]新增【尊王诸侯的抉择】规则，默认【人心离散】，并提供【誓死尊王】一期兼容项。
[*]尊王派直属封臣新增必叛、必留与一次性概率判定；判定结果在头衔和封臣关系变化前冻结。
[*]最终留下的忠臣不再经过原版弱势王国/帝国裁剪与改国号入口，原主头衔、国号和封臣树保持不变。
[*]新增群雄割据后的【人心向背】总结事件，并补齐九种发布语言。
[*]一期后朝、51% 原版门槛、宣称复辟与后朝销毁流程保持不变。
[/list]

