[h1]Verification / 验收[/h1]

The release uses a reproducible 32-file staging tree. The 0.2 acceptance matrix additionally verifies a guaranteed loyalist retaining the exact “Qingxu Circuit” title and subtree, a disloyal Pro-Hegemon lord rebelling, the one-shot outcome records, and the player-facing reckoning; all 0.1 restoration assertions remain in the same MCP-first CK3 1.19.0.6 run.
正式版本使用可复现的 32 文件 staging。0.2 验收矩阵新增验证：必留忠臣原样保住【青徐路】头衔与封臣树、不忠的尊王诸侯确实反叛、一次性判定记录及玩家可见的结果总结；0.1 版全部复辟断言仍在同一条 MCP-first CK3 1.19.0.6 实机链中回归。

[h1]Localization / 本地化[/h1]

English / 简体中文 / Français / Deutsch / 日本語 / 한국어 / Polski / Русский / Español

The seven additional release languages were generated as MiniMax-M3 candidates and reviewed and corrected for meaning, terminology and CK3 formatting. This is model-led review, not native-speaker certification.
七种新增发布语言先由 MiniMax-M3 产出候选，再逐条审核并修正语义、术语与 CK3 格式；这是模型代行的发布审核，不冒充母语译者认证。

[h1]Compatibility / 兼容性[/h1]

Requires CK3 1.19.0.6 and All Under Heaven. Start a new single-player game. In multiplayer, a human Pro-Hegemon vassal uses the same frozen factors and a public deterministic 50-point boundary because the atomic shattering effect cannot pause for several clients. This mod overrides exactly two vanilla keys: [code]tgp_chaos_shattering_effect[/code] and [code]situation_dynastic_cycle_claim_mandate_decision[/code]. Mods replacing either key may conflict by load order.
需要 CK3 1.19.0.6 与《溥天之下 / All Under Heaven》，推荐新开单人存档。多人游戏中，由于裂解过程无法暂停并逐个等待多名客户端，人类尊王封臣使用同一套冻结因素及公开的 50 分确定性分界。本 mod 只覆写两个原版 key：[code]tgp_chaos_shattering_effect[/code] 与 [code]situation_dynastic_cycle_claim_mandate_decision[/code]；其他 mod 若覆写其中之一，可能发生加载顺序冲突。

